WEBVTT

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:31.499
Call me only if it's urgent."

00:03:32.124 --> 00:03:33.751
To uphold these personal goals,

00:03:33.751 --> 00:03:35.378
work together as a team.

00:03:35.628 --> 00:03:38.339
Set team goals for personal time.

00:03:38.464 --> 00:03:39.465
Do it publicly,

00:03:39.465 --> 00:03:40.466
collect data

00:03:40.466 --> 00:03:42.176
and hold each other accountable.

00:03:42.677 --> 00:03:44.095
These goals could sound like,

00:03:44.095 --> 00:03:47.223
“I will not check email
between 6:00 and 8:00pm;”

00:03:47.223 --> 00:03:49.934
“I will have dinner with my family
four nights a week;”

00:03:49.934 --> 00:03:51.644
or "I will go for a jog midday."

00:03:51.936 --> 00:03:53.604
Check in on your team’s progress

00:03:53.604 --> 00:03:55.064
and see how everyone's doing.

00:03:55.106 --> 00:03:58.025
If you or your teammates are unsuccessful,

00:03:58.025 --> 00:04:00.653
work together to help
accomplish personal goals.